      Q("zhengzhe", zh("你/nǐ 现在/xiànzài 别/bié 找/zhǎo 他/tā ， 他/tā 正在/zhèngzài 开/kāi （　） 会/huì 呢/ne 。"), ["着/zhe", "了/le", "过/guo", "完/wán"],
        ["", "正在…了 isn't the pattern.", "过 = experience.", "开完 = finished."],
        "**正在 + V着 + 呢**.", "Don't look for him now — he's in a meeting."),
      Q("zhengzhe", "Which sentence is correct?", ["外面/wàimiàn 正/zhèng 下/xià 着/zhe 雨/yǔ 呢/ne 。", "外面/wàimiàn 正/zhèng 下/xià 了/le 雨/yǔ 呢/ne 。", "外面/wàimiàn 正/zhèng 着/zhe 下/xià 雨/yǔ 呢/ne 。", "外面/wàimiàn 下/xià 着/zhe 正/zhèng 雨/yǔ 呢/ne 。"],
        ["", "正 doesn't go with 了.", "着 follows the verb.", "正 goes before the verb."],
        "**正 + V + 着 + O + 呢**.", "It's raining outside right now."),
      Q("youbu", zh("我/wǒ （　） 不/bú 是/shì 小孩子/xiǎo háizi ， 你/nǐ 别/bié 管/guǎn 我/wǒ ！"), ["又/yòu", "再/zài", "很/hěn", "刚/gāng"],
        ["", "再不 = 'if … not again'.", "很不是 isn't grammatical.", "刚不是 isn't grammatical."],
        "Emphatic negation: **又不**.", "It's not as if I'm a child — stop bossing me around!"),
      Q("youbu", "What does 「" + zh("你/nǐ 又/yòu 没/méi 去/qù 过/guo ， 怎么/zěnme 知道/zhīdào 不/bù 好玩/hǎowán ？") + "」 mean?", ["You haven't even been there — how would you know it's no fun?", "You didn't go again — why is it no fun?", "You went again and it was no fun.", "You've been there, so you know it's no fun."],
        ["", "又没 here isn't 'again'.", "Nobody went.", "没去过 = has never been."],
        "又没 = **it's not as if**.", ""),
      Q("jiushi", zh("我/wǒ （　） 不/bù 想/xiǎng 去/qù ， 你/nǐ 别/bié 再/zài 说/shuō 了/le 。"), ["就是/jiùshì", "就要/jiùyào", "但是/dànshì", "于是/yúshì"],
        ["", "就要不想 isn't grammatical.", "但是 needs a contrast before it.", "于是 = 'and so'."],
        "Stubborn: **就是不**.", "I just don't want to go — stop going on about it."),
      Q("jiushi", zh("不管/bùguǎn 我/wǒ 怎么/zěnme 说/shuō ， 他/tā （　） 不/bù 听/tīng 。"), ["就是/jiùshì", "就要/jiùyào", "于是/yúshì", "但是/dànshì"],
        ["", "就要不听 isn't grammatical.", "于是 = 'and so'.", "但是 can't follow the subject here."],
        "**就是不**.", "No matter what I say, he simply won't listen."),
